{"id":"P100-2","subject":"P","unit":"P100","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P100-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n제어 시스템에서 개루프 전달함수의 이득 를 0에서 무한\n\n대까지 변화시킬 때, 폐루프 극점이 평면상에서 이동하는\n\n경로를 나타낸 것을 무엇이라 하는가?\n\n\n① 근궤적도(Root Locus)\n\n② 보드선도(Bode Diagram)\n\n③ 루스-허위츠 방법(Routh–Hurwitz Criterion)\n\n④ 나이퀴스트 선도(Nyquist Diagram)","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n직렬 2단자 회로의 극점과 영점의 특징으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 항상 극점만 존재하며 영점은 나타나지 않는다.\n\n② 극점과 영점은 음의 실수축에 대칭으로 나타난다.\n\n③ 극점과 영점은 음의 실수축에 있고, 교대로 나타난다.\n\n④ 극점과 영점은 허수축에 있고, 교대로 나타난다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":467},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1294}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n제어시스템의 특성방정식이 일\n\n때, 시스템이 안정되기 위한 의 범위는?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n       \n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":623},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":922}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n응답이 처음에 목푯값에 도달하는데 걸리는 시간으로, 일반\n\n적으로 목푯값의 10부터 90에 도달하는데 걸리는\n\n시간을 뜻하는 과도응답 용어는?\n\n\n① 정지시간       ② 지연시간\n\n③ 상승시간       ④ 응답시간","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":959}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n직류전원 V를 회로에 s에 인가할 때, 회로에\n흐르는 전류가 × A 였다. 이 회로\n\n의 저항을 2배로 하는 경우의 시정수s는?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 25          ④ 50","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":632},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1360}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n저항 3Ω, 유도성 리액턴스 4Ω인 직렬회로에\n100V의 교류전압을 가할 때, 전류 A는?\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":522}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n10Ω, 1mH, 10F인 직렬회로가\n\n있다. 이 회로의 선택도 는?\n\n\n① 0.1          ② 1\n\n③ 10          ④ 100","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":890}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n2전력계법으로 3상 부하의 전력을 측정할 때, 각 전력계의\n지시값이 W, W일 때, 3상 부하\n\n의 역률은?\n\n\n①           ② \n                     \n③            ④      ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":627},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":992}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n직렬회로에서, 200Ω, 10mH , 5F\n\n이고, 공진상태일 때, 어드미턴스와 위상은?\n\n\n                    \n① 어드미턴스                 , 위상 °     \n\n                    \n② 어드미턴스                 , 위상 °     \n\n                    \n③ 어드미턴스                 , 위상 °     \n\n                    \n④ 어드미턴스                 , 위상 °     ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m34-q.webp","width":678,"height":673},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":913}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n정전용량이 F인 평행판 콘덴서 양단에 V의 전압\n\n을 걸어 C의 전하를 충전 하였을 때, 평행판 사이의\n\n전계가 Vm였다. 이 콘덴서의 두 평행판 사이에 작용\n\n하는 힘N 은? (단, 두 평행판 사이에 채워진 매질의 유전\n율은 Fm, 콘덴서 극판의 면적은 m이다.)\n\n①        ②                                \n③          ④                                  ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":695},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":969}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n전계가 sinVm인 평면 전자파가 전\n\n파될 때, 자계의 세기 Am는?\n\n(단, 전파 매질의 특성 임피던스는 Ω이다.)\n\n\n                            \n①     sin  ②     sin      \n\n                             \n③      sin④       sin    ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":515},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n전달함수(Transfer Function)에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 시간영역에서의 입력과 출력비 비를 의미한다.\n\n② 초깃값이 0인 선형 시불변 시스템에서 출력의 라플라스\n\n  변환과 입력의 라플라스 변환의 비를 의미한다.\n\n③ 비선형 상태에서도 전달함수의 표현이 가능하다.\n\n④ 전달함수의 분자가 0이 되는 식을 특성 방정식이라 한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":548},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n직렬회로에서 s에서 스위치 를 닫아 입력\nV를 주면 회로에 출력으로 전류 가 흐르게 된다.\nΩ, H, F일 때, 이 회로의\n\n과도상태는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 무제동        ② 임계제동\n\n③ 부족제동       ④ 과제동","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":815},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":967}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n변위전류에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 시간에 따른 전기장의 변화로 인해 항상 도체내에서만\n\n  유도되는 전류이다.\n\n② 자연스럽게 생기는 전류로서, 항상 도체 내 자유전자들의\n\n  이동에 의해 발생한다.\n\n③ 축전기의 유전체에 작용하는 변위전류는 전도전류보다\n\n  항상 크게 작용한다.\n\n④ 코일에 유도되는 전류처럼 자계의 변화를 일으키며,\n\n  자계의 회전과 연관된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":520},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":915},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m39-e2.webp","width":678,"height":480}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P100-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n              \n함수         의 라플라스 역변환은?  \n\n\n①      ② \n③       ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.23 한국동서발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e19-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":1881},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e19-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1404}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
